"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688881677311,"modifiedTime":1688881702558,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kquBnQ0kObZztnBc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"KOYQY3taPV08OjDQ"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Duo Bird Brains","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Each of a wackadodo's heads rolls their own initiative and has their own turn. Neither of the wackadodo's heads can Delay. At the start of one of the wackadodo's heads' turns, that head gets 2 actions and 1 reaction. Either of the heads, or both, can move the wackadodo's legs on any given turn. Any ability that would sever a wackadodo's head (such as the vorpal weapon property) doesn't cause the wackadodo to die as long as the wackadodo still has their other head intact, but it does cause the wackadodo to lose the turns, actions, and reactions that would ordinarily come from the severed head. Mental effects that can only target a single creature affect only one of the wackadodo's heads, but not both.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"wBctoCIfBZ7rijID","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688881803631,"modifiedTime":1688928071107,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Talon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"nz3FIoPCGGEeAv4m":{"damage":"2d12+8","damageType":"slashing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":14},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"1EJFALZqNHhUB5eG","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688882397420,"modifiedTime":1688882423456,"lastModifiedBy":"CIWVguTLismR00HG","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Beak","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","reach-10"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"6soakypxdTUYIvfi":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":14},"attackEffects":{"value":["gyrating-fever"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"8LElu381A7EsdSK9","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"CIWVguTLismR00HG":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688882399203,"modifiedTime":1691127786599,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Awkward Dance","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The wackadodo bobs its head while shaking its tail feathers and Strides up to half its speed. Each creature within 30 feet of the wackadodo at the end of their movement must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:22] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Awkward Dance for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round and is temporarily immune to Awkward Dance for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Fascinated]{Fascinated} by the wackadodo, and it's @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} as long as it's fascinated. Hostile actions against the fascinated creature's allies don't end this fascination, though hostile actions against the fascinated creature itself ends the fascination for that creature.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Confused]{Confused} for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}. Once the confusion ends, the creature suffers the failure effects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["emotion","incapacitation","mental","occult","visual"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"59PfjTmPKrw5Y8ct","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"defaul